### Login
POST http://localhost:3001/api/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "mario",
  "password": "Marioo00"
}

### Login (wrong password)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "anna",
  "password": "Wrong_password"
}

### Current user
GET http://localhost:3001/api/sessions/current

### Logout
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/sessions/current

### Setup Network
GET http://localhost:3001/api/network/setup

### Play Network
GET http://localhost:3001/api/network/play

### Leaderboard
GET http://localhost:3001/api/leaderboard

### Start game
POST http://localhost:3001/api/games/start

### Submit game
POST http://localhost:3001/api/games/51/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "path": [22, 12, 3, 11]
}